- All of branch valve a waiting for leak test and Troubleshooting Actuator by E&amp;I.', '2024-09-02 09:08:17', '2024-09-25 16:23:16', 'PTTEP\\art.mechcrane', 'PTTEP\\Art.MechSupervisor', false, 'ART') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
