ep investigation as following…</p>  <ul type="disc">  <li>Simulating case to check      time and even log to compare with the alarm log of activated ESD-1.</li> </ul>  <p>- Case no1. Check solenoid ESD1 self-activate.</p>  <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - Case no2. PLC self-tripping, power loos, vibration test.</p>  <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- Case no3. RTU relay ESD-1 power loss and cable loosing. </p>  <p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- Case no4. Fire and Fusible plug loop test (After replaced PG.)</p>  <p><br></p>', '<p class="MsoNormal">Data information as link below..<o:p></o:p></p>

