;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </p><p>          </p><p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Cleaned flame arrester of diesel fuel storage tank.</p><p><br></p><p><b><u>Air induction system</u></b>.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </p><p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Inspected, cleaned Air intake filter and replace new primary air filter sheet (M80)</p><p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Inspected air inlet system for any leaks no found leak.</p><p>      </p><p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Visual checked the Turbocharger still good condition. (0.40 mm)</p><p><br></p><p><b><u>Pump and gearbox</u></b><u>. </u></p><p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Inspected coupling and lubricate universal joint with grease. (EP-2)</p><p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Found rubber seals of universal joint were damage and grease nipple was broken.</span></p><p>      </p><p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Checked all coupling bolt tightness, all bolt were tighten. &nbsp;(Wrench 15/16” and Allen-key 14 mm.)&nbsp;</p><p><br></p><p><b><u>Air starting supply.</u></b></p><p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Change lube oil of air compressor. (Compressor oil 100)</p><p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Adjusted belt tension. (Wrench 13 mm, 10 mm. and&nbsp; ½”)</p><p>-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Cleaned the skid.</p><p>            </p><p>-&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Test unit running properly.</p><p><br></p><p><br></p><p><br></p>', '

