 ( Standard gas = 80.0 %&nbsp; +/- 1 % )</p><p>- Online sample loop and monitoring reading value with CCR , Found there are reading as normal.</p>', NULL, '2024-11-02 17:12:11', '2024-11-04 14:18:40', 'PTTEP\\GBS.EI-Workshop', 'PTTEP\\GBS.EI-Workshop', false, 'G2S') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
