l for full test run.</span></p><p><br></p></div></div></div></div><div><div><p><br></p></div></div>', NULL, '2024-11-04 17:22:36', '2024-11-04 19:27:33', 'PTTEP\\ZOC.Inst-Tec', 'PTTEP\\ZOC.Inst-Tec', false, 'ATL') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
