><p>Measure insulation resistance value (IR) and resistance value (R) of Heater at EDG control panel (Switchgear).&nbsp;</p><p>Measure the earth loop resistance of frame ground, Power earth ground and Instrument earth ground.</p><p><br></p><p>Test run for 30 mins and EDG 8935 is running properly.<br>100% Completed.</p><p><br></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW171906285 BCX0" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" paraid="889659768" paraeid="{253ef7e1-a550-44b5-be8c-69ad2232440b}{8}"><u><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">History(09-11-2024)</b></u></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW171906285 BCX0" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" paraid="889659768" paraeid="{253ef7e1-a550-44b5-be8c-69ad2232440b}{8}"><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">12MPM EDG-8935 day 1</span></p><p class="Paragraph SCXW171906285 BCX0" xml:lang="EN-US" lang="EN-US" paraid="889659768" paraeid="{253ef7e1-a550-44b5-be8c-69ad2232440b}{8}"><u><b style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Action</b></u></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Perform electrical isolation.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Checked and tightening the terminal connection control panel inside generator container.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Measure insulation resistance value (IR) and resistance value (R) of stator winding.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Measure insulation resistance value (IR) of Main Power Cable.<br>Measure insulation resistance value (IR) and resistance value (R) of anti-condensation Heater.</span></p><p><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Measure insulation resistance value (IR) and&nbsp;resistance value (R)&nbsp;Permanence Magnet Generator (PMG) exciter winding.</span></p><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Measure insulation resistance value (IR) and&nbsp;resistance value (R)&nbsp;of Exciter stator winding.</span></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br></span></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);">Torque for Power cable is 80 Nm.<br>Torque for Winding cable is 35 Nm.</span></div><div><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 0);"><br>50% Completed.</span></div>', NULL, '2024-11-10 10:55:21', '2024-11-25 14:42:14', 'PTTEP\\ZOC.Elec-Tec', 'PTTEP\\ZOC.Elec-Tec', false, 'ATL') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
