u>As Left V/T</u></div><div><br></div><div>Pt(1) – V/t = 5.0... span gas concentration (C1) = 30 PPM&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>-Compare the H2S value with the dragger tube. The AT-8010 is reading 14 PPM, and the dragger tube is reading 11 PPM.</div><div><br></div><div>Spare part ITEM#&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>60.51.74.105.3 COALESCEUR FLT KIT,DELMAR,P/N.073-028-00</div><div><br></div><div>60.51.74.135.3&nbsp;HUMIDIFYING ELEMENT,DELMAR,PN.070.001.00</div><div>60.51.74.136.3 HYDROFOBIC MEMBR KIT, DELMAR, P/N.070.067</div><div><br></div><div><br></div>', '<p><a href="G:\\Selective Access\\02-PBN-M\\02 MEI\\19 Photos\\01 Instrument Photos\\05.SPP\\AIT-8030\\AIT-8030 Instrument 3 MPPM on 30 Dec 24">G:\\Selective Access\\02-PBN-M\\02 MEI\\19 Photos\\01 Instrument Photos\\05.SPP\\AIT-8030\\AIT-8030 Instrument 3 MPPM on 30 Dec 24</a><br></p>', '2024-11-29 07:15:48', '2024-12-01 22:18:31', 'PTTEP\\Bongkot.Inst-Lead', 'PTTEP\\Bongkot.Inst-Lead', false, 'G2N') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
