div><div><br></div><div>As found V/T</div><div><br></div><div>Pt(1) – Vt = 0.0... gas concentration (C1)&nbsp; 13 PPM&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>Pt(2) - Vt = 0.0... span gas concentration (C2) 0 PPM</div><div><br></div><div>-Perfomed apply the STD gas at 13 PPM (we have no STD gas at 53 PPM and 27 PPM) and performed calibrate new Vt by value from the process found analyzer normal reading</div><div><br></div><div><div>As left Vt</div><div><br></div><div>Pt(1) – Vt = 14.60... gas concentration (C1)&nbsp; 50 PPM&nbsp; &nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div><div>-Compare the H2S value with the dragger tube. The AT-8010 is reading 20 PPM, and the dragger tube is reading 19 PPM.</div><div><br></div></div><div> </div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</div></div><div>Spare part ITEM#&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>60.51.74.105.3 COALESCEUR FLT KIT, DELMAR, P/N.073-028-00</div><div><br></div><div>60.51.74.135.3&nbsp;HUMIDIFYING ELEMENT,DELMAR,PN.070.001.00</div><div>60.51.74.136.3 HYDROFOBIC MEMBR KIT, DELMAR, P/N.070.067</div><div><br></div>', NULL, '2024-11-30 19:50:02', '2024-12-01 22:16:25', 'PTTEP\\Bongkot.Inst-Lead', 'PTTEP\\Bongkot.Inst-Lead', false, 'G2N') RETURNING id INTO new_report_id;
